<languages />
{{Navbar modding}}
{{Page version|42.7.0}}

<translate>
==== CustomContextMenu ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Changes the context menu item "Eat" of the food to the one specified in the parameter.
</translate>
{{CodeSnip
| lang = java
| code =
CustomContextMenu = Smoke,
}}

<translate>
<!--T:3-->
To translate the custom context menu entry, simply add a {{ll|Translations|translation}} entry in the file
</translate> {{Code|ContextMenu}} <translate>
<!--T:4-->
of your mod. For example:
</translate>
{{CodeSnip
| lang = lua
| code =
ContextMenu_Smoke = "Smoke this item",
}}

{{ll|Category:Item scripts parameters}}